{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1064201001:0":{"text":"아인, 일어나!","source_cn":"埃因！醒醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x976840BEFCF60790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064201002:0":{"text":"...지원군이야!","source_cn":"……是援军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754D88C658BA1AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064201003:0":{"text":"마이카...?","source_cn":"迈克尔……?","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DA547352FBA73A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064201004:0":{"text":"봐! 금빛 마법진이야!\n지원군의 마법진이라고!","source_cn":"看呐！金色的魔法阵！\\n是援军的魔法阵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C4470C54160E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064201005:1":{"text":"너... 아직 살아 있었구나...","source_cn":"你竟然……还活着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFAB4E6CC7789C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064201006:1":{"text":"무슨 소리야? 당연히 살아있지!","source_cn":"说什么呢！我当然还活着！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2282CC4B8275EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064201007:1":{"text":"이 전쟁이 끝나면, 같이 너희 집으로 가서 네 어머니가 빚으신 술을 마시기로 약속했잖아?","source_cn":"不是说好了？等这场仗打完，要回你家，喝你母亲酿的酒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EA45706437FDCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064201008:1":{"text":"아직 술 냄새도 못 맡아봤는데, 여기서 죽을 수는 없지. 너도 마찬가지야.","source_cn":"我连酒味都没闻到呢，可不能死在战场上，你也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DD3642F97A2DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064201009:1":{"text":"지원군이 곧 도착할 거야. 너도, 나도 죽지 않고 더 많은 전우들을 구할 수 있어! 조금만 더...","source_cn":"援军马上到了，你我都死不了，我们还能再多救几个战友！只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A7E7D0184F1C88C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064201010:1":{"text":"으아악!","source_cn":"呃啊！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C5139328AF3E7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064201011:0":{"text":"<shk>아... 안돼...! 마이카...! 안돼!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不不不！迈克尔……！！不！！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54ED33CFDE5118AF","variant_stat