document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064201017:1":{"text":"같이...","source_cn":"一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC35BD49A14B1B50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064201018:1":{"text":"돌아가자...","source_cn":"回家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54132654101E40CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064201019:0":{"text":"아인... 아인!","source_cn":"埃因……埃因!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED06D310AFD43B7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064201020:0":{"text":"엄마...","source_cn":"妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1754BAE5724FDA08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064201021:0":{"text":"아인은 눈을 떠 어머니를 바라보았다. 지친 어머니의 얼굴, 그 주름 하나하나에는 깊은 걱정이 배어 있었다.","source_cn":"埃因睁开眼，望着眼前的母亲，从母亲疲惫的脸上，他看见藏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7F4861A38C941BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064201022:0":{"text":"어머니가 마지막으로 웃은 게 언제였을까? 더는 기억이 나지 않았다.","source_cn":"母亲上次笑是什么时候？他想不起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB31D9EE46A35095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064201023:1":{"text":"어머니가 기쁨의 눈물을 흘린 건, 아마 자신이 살아 돌아왔던 그날뿐이었을 것이다. 그날 이후 어머니의 얼굴에는 늘 깊은 근심만이 맴돌았다.","source_cn":"好像只有他活着回来的那天，母亲喜极而泣。自那以后，只剩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29E16309AFBDFEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064201024:1":{"text":"자신을 걱정하는 어머니와 눈이 마주칠 때마다, 보이지 않는 두 손이 목을 조르는 것만 같았다.","source_cn":"每每和担忧自己的母亲对上视线，都有一双无形的手伸出来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450000BCF47FD93F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064201025:0":{"text":"이번에도 어김없이 가슴이 턱 막혀온 아인은, 애써 눈을 감으며 그 모습을 외면하려 했다.","source_cn":"这一次，埃因又觉得喘不上气了，于是他用力合上眼，不再去看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26C9624CE7EA184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064201026:0":{"text":"네가 크게 소리를 질러서... 또 그 악몽을 꾼 거니?","source_cn":"你叫得好大声……又做那个噩梦了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32CD78A33FC1B375","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064201027:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064201028:0":{"text":"아... 말하기 싫으면 하지 않아도 된단다. 정원에 꽃이 피었는데, 구경하러 가겠니? 엄마가 밀어줄게.","source_cn":"唉……不说就不说吧。院里的花开了，妈推你去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3F5C70E5A2BB264","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064201029:0":{"text":"네 전우들이 편지를 보내왔어. 이번에는 케이트와 사미르라고 하는구나. 지난번에 라운이 보낸 것도 아직도 뜯지 않았잖니...","source_cn":"对了，你的战友又给你寄了信来。这次是凯特和萨米尔，上次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AC28254C42BD467","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064201030:0":{"text":"거기 둬...","source_cn":"放那吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8580DA21EF6AE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064201031:0":{"text":"어깨를 잡으렴. 엄마가 일으켜 줄게. 일단 기저귀부터 갈아야지...","source_cn":"来，勾着我的肩膀，妈扶你坐起来，咱先把尿布换了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD17D9C794291D576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064201032:0":{"text":"필요 없다니까!","source_cn":"不用你帮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B8CA2F1029FE194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064201033:0":{"text":"다리를 움직이지도 못하면서. 이런 일은 엄마가...","source_cn":"你的腿又不能动，这些事让妈来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8223070610115F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064201034:0":{"text":"필요 없다고 했잖아! 몇 번을 더 말해야 알아듣는데?!","source_cn":"我说了！用不着！你还要让我说多少回？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x983A56346591D156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064201035:1":{"text":"아인...","source_cn":"埃因……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x655769EFEC018176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064201036:0":{"text":"다 큰 어른이 기저귀 차는 게 뭐 좋은 일이라고! 심지어 그걸 엄마가 갈아줘야 한다고?!","source_cn":"我这么大的人，竟然要用尿布！更别说还要让自己的妈帮我换！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B1306CC8494D830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064201037:0":{"text":"평생 이런 꼴로 살 바에는... 그냥 그때 마이카랑 같이 죽었어야 했는데!","source_cn":"如果一辈子都这样……当初，我不如陪迈克尔他们一起死！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93EFBE278F6DFDDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064201038:0":{"text":"그런 말 하지 마!\n네 아버지도 마물 때문에 돌아가셨는데, 너마저 없으면... 엄마는 어떻게 살라고!","source_cn":"妈不要你死！\\n你爹已经被魔物杀了，要是你没了……让妈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DEF66A52B94AC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064201039:1":{"text":"네가 전쟁에 나갔을 때, 매일 듀라 여신님께 기도했단다... 네가 살아 돌아오기를 바란다고! 그리고 여신님은 그 소원을 들어주셨지!","source_cn":"你去打仗，妈每天都向艾雅女神祈祷……希望你活着回来，女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A842FD85F295EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064201040:1":{"text":"엄마는 지금도 매일 네 다리가 다 낫기를 기도하고 있어.","source_cn":"现在妈也每天去神殿，每天都向女神祈祷！祈祷你的双腿能恢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE83E2FCCAAEBE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064201041:0":{"text":"여신님께서 분명히 그 기도에 응답해 주실 거란다!","source_cn":"女神也一定会回应我的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75BA3ACCF1A826F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064201042:0":{"text":"듀라? 하하하... 말도 안 되는 소리!","source_cn":"艾雅？呵呵呵……可笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0860FF12E7E21778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064201043:0":{"text":"